{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act35side_level_act35side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act35side",
  "stageId": "act35side_05",
  "title": "文物也上班",
  "storyCode": "AS-5",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f09b67869f475932a4af365963a8682fbf09c90321ee63c06d23622c998fbfbf",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们在等什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "电话。对你这样上年纪的人来说，可能是有点新奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们还要在这里等多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要怀疑，等就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等会儿能让我接电话吗？之前已经有人给我讲解过用法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不不不，不行，你这个机械合成的嗓音一出声，别人会当成诈骗电话的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对了，按照你的说法，我们俩的合作是对历史上伟大同盟的效仿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那请问，给你跑腿找宝石对我有什么好处？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，我确实有所收获。昨天半夜你吓到我的时候，我收获了这只飞到脸上的金拖鞋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你有什么建议吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——不敢有，不敢有，我活着就是您最大的恩赐，您是萨尔贡的祖宗，带着您寻找宝石是我该做的，您千万别激动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，赢得丰获集会第一名的文物好像也是这么一只纯金镶蓝宝石的拖鞋......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，它们应该恰好成对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这么说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "半夜在大街上尖叫扰民，也是一种发家手段？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......原本成对的文物，其中一件永远沉进河底遗失，另一件自然也失去了大半价值。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......请允许我好奇。这个时代的梦魇......都是像你这样行事的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你问倒我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为了打劫、倒卖和绑架，我调查过各大部族的风俗和信仰，但真没调查过我自己的出生地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "从某个清晨日出之后，我就再也没回去过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如此说来，你难道......正走在自己的天途上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天途？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（古老的语言）天途。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——不不不，我一点也不想听到这个词。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我才不走天途，就算是我的老祖宗逼我也没用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你难道至今没有践行成年的仪式？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，又不是什么重要的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也许有一点梦魇的血统，但那几滴血没把我变成暴君和征服者，我也不打算让它影响我自己的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，这很重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若不走过天途，你的血要如何被你的先祖认可？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没事，我的老祖宗们多半都失踪在大地尽头了，不会像你一样突然从博物馆里坐起来骂我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对了，那你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我听说沙阿时代的人们会在成年时剃个光头，然后涂上香膏。但又有人说，所谓的“香膏”其实很难闻......我可好奇了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，等到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......怎么，这么快就有宝石的消息了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宝石掮客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，女士，十分巧合，刚刚宝石交易所的监管人放出消息，他手中有一块宝石亟待交易，各方面都符合您的描述。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，我要直接去见他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宝石掮客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是......即使有我从中介绍，你也很难直接和监管人谈这笔交易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么？我听我手下说，她们直接找前台就能卖宝石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宝石掮客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卖倒是容易，买就不一样了。宝石交易所并不是一般的商铺，你需要拿出够分量的砝码，才能从监管人手上直接拿到东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "够分量的砝码？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我有个想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳，是的，这就是我想谈的生意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "近期正在博物馆展出的古尸......沙阿时代的无名将领。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "宝石交易所年轻的监管人神情复杂地看了她一眼，然后在巨大的镀金箱子前俯下身。\n祖拜尔以双手交叠胸前的姿态，宁静地平躺着。\n平心而论，娜仁图亚认为这是祖拜尔最有价值的时刻，连那骇人的黄金面具都仿佛散发出了神圣的柔光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个箱子很眼熟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就是从博物馆原样搬出来的棺材......的仿制品，仿制品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......（轻轻敲打祖拜尔的身躯）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（用手电检查胸腔内部）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，这可不是一般的文物，你下手轻点，别这么不专业。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我听说它已经复活了，能够自如行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个嘛，我们都知道人死不能复生，都是源石技艺表演而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再说，如果它真的会动，你不害怕吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怕我买下来之后它又自己逃走吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这个嘛......\n哎呀，那只黑色的动物是你的宠物？哈哈，真美呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不愧是宝石交易所的监管人，掌握整座城市金钱流通的人，连宠物都如此与众不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小声）沃奥，是他吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（嗅探）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（在棺材旁坐下）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿，你看，它闻出来了，这种死了上千年的气味是不可能伪造的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像我跟你做交易的诚意也是半点不掺假的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然，我知道这件文物太过珍贵，就算对你来说也没那么容易处理——对，我是甩了个麻烦给你，所以我不指望能赚太多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我保证博物馆没办法查到我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，你给出了很重的砝码。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是远没有到我的秤无法衡量的程度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......啊，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你想交换什么？我听说你是为一颗宝石来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，本来是这样，但来的路上我有了个新想法，那颗宝石我不需要了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是外来的，给我金条就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赤金结算？我去取合适的秤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "麻烦你先把货物移进里间，免得被其他人看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那......合作愉快？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，我就喜欢这么爽快的人！"
