    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我一点也不喜欢睡回这个棺材的感觉。你其实没必要让你的手下特地把它运出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘘，你别说话......稍微再忍忍，我很快就回来接你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你抓紧时间，在今天之内找到你要的那颗宝石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，千万别忘了。我还找你有事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是我的报价，你意下如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......♪忘不了刀刃上的月牙，少年的真心洗成黄金♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真是忘不了......没意见，完全没意见！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我就离开啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（对祖拜尔眨眨眼睛）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（对娜仁图亚眨眨眼睛）"
